	    <p>
		A modern and efficient web-based dashboard application developed in Python using the Plotly/Dash libraries. This project provides a comprehensive overview of threat data, visualizing critical insights through interactive charts and graphs. The codebase is clean, well-structured, and fully type-annotated, ensuring clarity and maintainability.
	    </p>
	    <p>
		The project adheres to rigorous coding standards, passing mypy --strict type checks and flake8 linting tests. It leverages Docker for streamlined development and deployment, running on a Rocky Linux 9 image and served with Gunicorn via Supervisord. This setup ensures a robust and scalable environment, ideal for production deployments.
	    </p>
