	    </ul>

	    <p>
		A highly efficient and modern Python module implementing the 64-bit FNV-1a hash algorithm. This module provides a fast and reliable hashing function that is suitable for a variety of applications, including data storage, retrieval, and validation. The code is clean, well-structured, and fully type-annotated, ensuring both performance and maintainability.
	    </p>
	    <p>
